  "2026-10-24T09:41:58.932Z","harness:codex","Implementation scope: reuse canonical SDK and package-platform lineage; inspect active extension item_fields separately from runtime schema fields, then extend shared projection validation without importing query runtimes into contract-only modules. Preserve value types, unknown-field refusal, and activation isolation. Full all-status strict corpus read: 3094 items, 2806 closed, no omissions or unreadables. Current GitHub has no open PRs or dependency/security alerts; every open issue already has a PM-link comment."
