  "2026-10-24T09:54:58.084Z","harness:codex","Latest package acceptance: installed pm-changelog2026.10.24 from the public npm registry, matching the latest exact published version. Package doctor has zero activation failures or blocking findings, and the package-owned changelog check passes before closure. Its managed contribution inventory now includes changelog contracts, so the real version/contribution change is retained as generated metadata. No changelog generator code is added or patched in pm-cli; upstream pm-changelog currently has no open issues or PRs."
