  "2026-10-24T10:52:25.673Z","harness:codex","Hosted source acceptance at3ecc13b6a0171e41cc359818033026f4fcb7d8d1: Nightly run40086359843 passes all14 platform legs, including both Ubuntu22 and all4 Windows24 shards. Its merged coverage job120852281042 reports859 passing files,11197 passing tests,3 existing platform skips and exact100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts. The separate quality job stops only at3 new prose-to-edge omissions. Those genuine lineage edges are now recorded through PM, and local graph-composition passes9/9, append-only record integrity passes, the unchanged quiet transport gate passes all6 operations, and the configured mutation gate passes352 mutants with345 killed and7 reviewed equivalents. The final PR must still validate its closed-tracker/changelog head; no whole-workflow-green claim is made for the earlier source run."
